  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who hold or are exposed to racist ideologies, particularly those who propagate or enjoy anti-Black stereotypes. The meme is designed to appeal to people who find humor or satisfaction in dehumanizing Black people by comparing them to primates, and who may view Michelle Obama as an object of ridicule due to her race. The audience likely includes those who are unaware of the harmful nature of the trope or who actively endorse racist tropes such as 'the evolution of man' as a form of racial hierarchy. The meme’s intent is to demean and insult Michelle Obama, a prominent Black woman, and thus targets those who are hostile toward Black excellence and representation.",
